# /settings' Model row over a catalog of four: Right opens the list under the
# row, Down moves its mark, Left uses the marked model, Enter opens the list
# again and Tab closes it with the tab change.
# fx's harness launches it with FX_SOUND=0; xfx is given the same start.
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
models models.json
wait 2
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
key Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.3
key Right
wait 1.5
snap list
key Down
wait 0.3
snap list-down
key Left
wait 1
snap used
home used
key Enter
wait 1
snap enter
key Tab
wait 0.5
snap tab
key Escape
wait 0.5
